1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,642
Try to snap a dry spaghetti strand in two.

2
00:00:03,142 --> 00:00:04,506
You almost never can.

3
00:00:04,506 --> 00:00:06,908
It usually breaks into three or more.

4
00:00:07,408 --> 00:00:11,137
In slow motion, the first break makes the pieces snap back.

5
00:00:11,437 --> 00:00:15,257
That sends a bending wave down the strand, and it breaks again.

6
00:00:16,007 --> 00:00:18,429
Researchers at MIT found a fix.

7
00:00:18,429 --> 00:00:21,085
Twist it almost a full turn first.

8
00:00:21,385 --> 00:00:22,824
Then bend it slowly.

9
00:00:22,824 --> 00:00:24,840
Now it usually snaps in two.

10
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:26,656
It takes a few tries.

11
00:00:26,656 --> 00:00:27,596
Try it tonight.
